      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTIPHOLUS OF SYRACUSE.\nA trusty villain, sir, that very oft,\nWhen I am dull with care and melancholy,\nLightens my humour with his merry jests.\nWhat, will you walk with me about the town,\nAnd then go to my inn and dine with me?",
