      "id": "errors/sceneI_5.2/p@11749",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MERCHANT.\nI am invited, sir, to certain merchants,\nOf whom I hope to make much benefit.\nI crave your pardon. Soon, at five o’clock,\nPlease you, I’ll meet with you upon the mart,\nAnd afterward consort you till bedtime.\nMy present business calls me from you now.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
